  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/657/657-5.htm",
  "statuteText": "657:5 Forwarding Forms. –\n\nThe secretary of state shall retain for his own use so many application forms for absentee ballots as he may deem necessary and shall supply each town and city clerk in the state with so many of them as he may deem sufficient."
}
